# The election fold lets a campaign win the term the fold is already at,
# not only the next term. Two candidates that race for the same next term
# then both win it: the second campaign replaces the first leader in the
# same term, under another uuid. The oracle "election: every fold names
# one leader per term" (`note_terms`) must catch the fold that names the
# second leader. No excuse covers this oracle: it is an oracle-family
# mutant of #973 (reference checker and oracle mutants).
excuse: none
expect: caught
file: crates/lib/paros-client/src/election/fold.rs
--- find
                if term != self.term + 1 {
--- replace
                if term != self.term + 1 && term != self.term {
--- end
